WEBVTT

00:17:28.298 --> 00:17:32.021
uz mirkli sajutu aukstumu, 
nervus, kas beidzot pamodušies,

00:17:32.021 --> 00:17:36.948
tas bija debešķīgi, 
kā sniega brāzma!

00:17:36.948 --> 00:17:40.184
Taču neko no tā visa es Abedam neteicu.

00:17:40.184 --> 00:17:45.095
Es tikai pateicu, ka viņš nogalināja 
vienu cilvēku, nevis divus.

00:17:45.095 --> 00:17:49.639
Es nosaucu šī vīrieša vārdu.

00:17:49.639 --> 00:17:51.249
Un tad es teicu:

00:17:51.249 --> 00:17:53.239
„Ardievu!”

00:17:53.239 --> 00:17:54.859
Paldies.

00:17:54.859 --> 00:17:58.274
(Aplausi)